# Project Overview

This project implements a **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) Chatbot** that answers user questions based only on the content of a financial report. The application retrieves the most relevant document chunks using **FAISS vector search** and generates grounded responses using the **Google Gemini API**. The chatbot is built with **FastAPI** and is designed for deployment on **Render**. The project builds a vector index from a PDF or HTML report, stores embeddings, retrieves the most relevant text passages, and uses them to generate accurate answers.  

---

# Objective

* Build a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) chatbot.
* Retrieve relevant document passages using semantic search.
* Generate responses grounded only in the retrieved context.
* Deploy the application using FastAPI and Render.

---

# Features

* Financial report document ingestion
* PDF and HTML support
* Automatic text extraction
* Text chunking with overlap
* SentenceTransformer embeddings
* FAISS vector database
* Semantic search
* Google Gemini integration
* FastAPI REST API
* Render deployment support

