---

# Project Workflow

1. Read a financial report (PDF or HTML).
2. Extract plain text.
3. Split the text into overlapping chunks.
4. Generate embeddings using SentenceTransformer.
5. Store embeddings in a FAISS vector index.
6. Accept a user query through the FastAPI endpoint.
7. Retrieve the most relevant document chunks.
8. Send the retrieved context to Gemini.
9. Generate a grounded response.
10. Return the answer along with supporting excerpts.  

